            "description": {
              "content": "Returns a paginated list of financial transaction documents for all orders and donations on the merchant site. Supports filtering by transaction date range. By default returns up to 50 transaction documents per page. Use the cursor parameter from a previous response to paginate through all results. Each document groups the financial details for a single order or donation.",
